Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Adds the iPad 10's screen size (2360 x 1640 at 60 Hz) to the resolutions the
; Parsec Virtual Display Driver offers. Double-click to import (needs admin).
; Values are hexadecimal: 0x938 = 2360, 0x668 = 1640, 0x3c = 60.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Parsec\vdd\0]
"width"=dword:00000938
"height"=dword:00000668
"hz"=dword:0000003c
